WORK SESSIONS

This folder is where tamlinux-packages is handed from one session to the
next. It holds:

  WHATNOW        what was just done and what comes next. Read it first.
  W<n>-<name>    one record per work session: what was asked, what got
                 done, what failed and what is left.
  history/       records written before the 2026-11-17 cutover, moved
                 from docs/ai/ under D278. Read-only and not indexed;
                 only their links were repaired.

An AI agent starting here should be able to read WHATNOW and carry on
without asking Fred to repeat himself.

THE PROCEDURE

At the start of a session:

  1. Read this file, then WHATNOW. NEXT is the to-do list in order.
  2. Read the newest W record only when WHATNOW points to it.
  3. Keep records plain, short and factual. Do not edit history/.
  4. Revise WHATNOW before handing off, and commit the record with the
     work it describes.

D278 retired docs/ai/ in every live Tamlinux source tree. Candidate
selection and preparation records are operational history, so they
live in history/ rather than becoming W records.
